  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>An upscale campsite belonging to the Homair chain, with a real plus for dog owners: Argens beach, an officially dog-friendly zone, is reachable on foot via a path crossing the protected Villepey wetlands.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you book</h2>
      <p>The campsite also has a private jetty for renting paddleboards and kayaks on the Argens river. Visitors who stayed here with their dog report a warm welcome, with a treat offered on arrival and a poop-bag dispenser near the beach access.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the path to the beach crosses a protected natural area — keep your dog on a lead on this stretch.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Base Nature François Léotard and its Pacha beach are also accessible from the area, for a change of scenery on your walks.</p>
